{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"Notice that we were asked to find the one-sided limit, $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 3^-}h(x)$. This is the limit where $x$-values approach $3$ from the left.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"Let's find the limit as $x$ approaches $3$ from the left. We will use the fact that $h(x)=x^2-1$ for $x$-values smaller than $3$.\n\n$\\begin{align}\n\u0026\\phantom{=}\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 3^-}h(x)\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 3^-}x^2-1\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=(3)^2-1\u0026\\gray{\\text{Direct substitution}}\n\\\\\\\\\n\u0026=8\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"In conclusion, we found that $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 3^-}h(x)=8$.","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"$h(x)=\\begin{cases}\nx^2-1\u0026\\text{for }x\\leq3\n\\\\\\\\\n2x+1\u0026\\text{for }3\u003cx\u003c10\n\\end{cases}$\n\n**Find $\\displaystyle\\lim_{x\\to 3^-}h(x)$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1]]","images":{},"widgets":{"radio 1":{"alignment":"default","graded":true,"options":{"choices":[{"content":"$3$","correct":false},{"content":"$7$","correct":false},{"content":"$8$","correct":true,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false},{"content":"The limit doesn't exist.","correct":false,"isNoneOfTheAbove":false}],"countChoices":false,"deselectEnabled":false,"displayCount":null,"hasNoneOfTheAbove":false,"multipleSelect":false,"randomize":false},"static":false,"type":"radio","version":{"major":1,"minor":0}}}}}
